cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use l1-stream in your research, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "l1-stream: a Python client for the Unitree L1 LiDAR"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Shu
    given-names: Chunyee
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0007-1910-719X"
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/logibyte276/l1-stream"
abstract: >-
  A Python UDP client for the Unitree L1 LiDAR: packet parsing, thread-safe
  buffering, IMU rotation compensation, raw-datagram recording and replay,
  and a KISS-ICP odometry pipeline with map-quality metrics.
keywords:
  - lidar
  - unitree
  - robotics
  - point cloud
  - lidar odometry
  - kiss-icp
